{"4598120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Syndicate: Classified Operations", "steam_appid": 4598120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start small. Expand fast. Keep the world under control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a single city and turn it into the foundation of a growing intelligence network. Complete operations, earn resources, unlock new cities, and watch your influence spread across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/b1c322b8c1ac34a1419cd764710c81ad.poster.avif?t=1785977239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/b1c322b8c1ac34a1419cd764710c81ad.webm?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/b1c322b8c1ac34a1419cd764710c81ad.mp4?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Than Just Watching Numbers Go Up.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every operation feeds into something bigger. Push missions forward, automate your agents, invest in upgrades, and build a network that grows faster with every decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/f5784716e048342b25b356064b332baf.poster.avif?t=1785977239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/f5784716e048342b25b356064b332baf.webm?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/f5784716e048342b25b356064b332baf.mp4?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep Operations Running Under Pressure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your network is powerful, but it is not stable. Cities generate Heat as you operate, forcing you to balance growth, automation, and control before the situation turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/3027d16284a4ef68719905fff46c8e29.poster.avif?t=1785977239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/3027d16284a4ef68719905fff46c8e29.webm?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/3027d16284a4ef68719905fff46c8e29.mp4?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Respond to Cold War Crises.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackouts, lockdowns, riots, and other disruptions can interrupt your plans. React quickly, restore control, and keep your operation from losing momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/9f1be0dc94b4497ddd2d192c30452bcf.poster.avif?t=1785977239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/9f1be0dc94b4497ddd2d192c30452bcf.webm?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/9f1be0dc94b4497ddd2d192c30452bcf.mp4?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escalate From Local Operations to Global Control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a small covert operation grows into a Cold War machine spanning more cities, more threats, and more decisions. The bigger your network becomes, the harder it is to keep under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/b7320a910537d1edd540cd265a176d40.poster.avif?t=1785977239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/b7320a910537d1edd540cd265a176d40.webm?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/b7320a910537d1edd540cd265a176d40.mp4?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>465 upgrades to unlock</strong>, combining unique abilities with multi-rank improvements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>three escalating stages</strong>, each introducing new systems and threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to riots, blackouts, covert operations, nuclear launches, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fully voiced campaign featuring Brady Flanagan, an increasingly tense Cold War atmosphere, and an original soundtrack by Paul Michael Harrison.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start small. Expand fast. Keep the world under control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a single city and turn it into the foundation of a growing intelligence network. Complete operations, earn resources, unlock new cities, and watch your influence spread across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i