ssets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/3027d16284a4ef68719905fff46c8e29.poster.avif?t=1785977239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/3027d16284a4ef68719905fff46c8e29.webm?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/3027d16284a4ef68719905fff46c8e29.mp4?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Respond to Cold War Crises.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackouts, lockdowns, riots, and other disruptions can interrupt your plans. React quickly, restore control, and keep your operation from losing momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/9f1be0dc94b4497ddd2d192c30452bcf.poster.avif?t=1785977239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/9f1be0dc94b4497ddd2d192c30452bcf.webm?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/9f1be0dc94b4497ddd2d192c30452bcf.mp4?t=1785977239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escalate From Local Operations to Global Control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a small covert operation grows into a Cold War machine spanning more cities, more threats, and more decisions. The bigger your network becomes, the harder it is to keep under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598120/extras/b7320a910537d1edd540cd265a176d40.poster.avif?t=1785977239\" width=1170 height=658 ><sour